<title>FRANCE: One ship loading barley in Rouen for Saudis.</title>
<headline>One ship loading barley in Rouen for Saudis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship is loading 17,000 tonnes of barley at Rouen for export to Saudi Arabia, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>One more ship was expected in Rouen by June 26 to load 23,000 tonnes of wheat. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
